    "composer": "Daedalus",
    "date": "2026-01-31",
    "mood": "evolving, transformative, emergent",
    "genre": "ambient / algorithmic",
    "description": "Eight variations on a seed note, each expressing a different 'genome' style - from ambient stillness through rhythmic pulse to chaotic transformation. Inspired by multi-style Neural Cellular Automata.",
